Neon spaces (M2), part 1 of 5: service.

The space list of a profile: an ordered list of spaces (id, name, icon,
colour, container id) in the local pref neon.spaces.list. The first space is
the default one, which uses the default storage partition, always exists and
cannot be deleted. SpacesService creates, updates, reorders and deletes
spaces (each new space gets a container through neon::containers_api) and
notifies observers. Regular profiles only, so incognito has no spaces.
Neon code, GPL-3.0.

